# owrt-build - OpenWrt OCI Build System
#
# Multi-stage OCI-based build system for OpenWrt firmware.
# Provides fast, reproducible, incremental builds using:
#
#   - Content-addressable caching (CAS + action cache)
#   - Merkle-tree change detection (timestamp + hash two-tier)
#   - OCI container isolation (podman/docker/buildah)
#   - Parallel package builds in topological waves
#   - Early cutoff optimization (skip cascading rebuilds)
#
# Usage:
#   ./oci-build/owrt-build build              # Full pipeline
#   ./oci-build/owrt-build packages           # Incremental packages
#   ./oci-build/owrt-build cache status       # Cache stats
#   ./oci-build/owrt-build --help             # All options

